ary by complexity and availability. Please schedule a call with our sales team for a custom timeline.\n\nCan’t find what you’re looking for?\n\nContact Us--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nMembership | Empower Your Parenthood Journey — Nugget Savings (https://www.nuggetsavings.com/membership-2)\nciteturn81search8 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 3 weeks ago; \n  * Tap into underused financial hacks like marriage allowance and student loan refunds\n\nThis is for you if…\n\n  * You’re planning maternity leave or thinking about having a baby\n\n  * You’ve been shocked by how low your income will be during that time\n\n  * You’re financially anxious about the months ahead\n\n  * You want to feel in control of your money and know you’ve done everything you can\n\nWhat makes this different?\n\nThis isn’t another fluffy “save on coffee” budgeting talk. It’s strategic, legally aware, and focused on results.\n\nYou’ll leave knowing:\n✅ Exactly what to ask your employer for\n✅ How to claim money you didn’t know you were owed\n✅ What steps to take this week to make your maternity leave more financially secure\n\nRead more →\n\nYour Pregnancy and Maternity Money Timeline\n\n£19.99\n\nThere are so many moving parts of maternity leave to think about: benefits, KIT days, annual leave, childcare… ever wish there was just ONE place that told you what to apply for and when?!\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n (https://www.parentaly.com/join/coaching-program/parentaly-coaching-program)\nciteturn81search9 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last month; \nParentaly's goal is to empower working parents to successfully re-onboard and fulfill their career goals.\nBy registering for the program, you have access to up to 9 career coaching sessions throughout your parental leave. Visit our website to learn more.\n\nWhat is the cost of the Parentaly program, and do I have to pay for it?\n\nYour company is offering