ife.  I fell madly in love with two little redheads, who turned my world upside down and left me in a spiral of both chaos and beauty.  I was fiercely committed to my legal career, yet had no idea how to Image: 3 Redheadssurvive being a new working parent – and an attorney.  How to be an engaged mother at home – and a leader at work.\n\nI created Mindful Return after too many tears on the kitchen floor.  Too much overwhelm.  Too much guilt.  Too much anxiety.\n\nParents: Join our community community of incredible working parents through our 4-week, cohort-based programs for new moms and for new dads.  --------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nReturn-To-Work Programme - Avilio Group (https://aviliogroup.com/solution/return-to-work-programme/)\nciteturn81search11 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last month; \n\n# Return-To-Work Programme\n\n## Come Back Stronger, Sharper and More Resilient\n\n£2,975 (+VAT) per person\n\n## Course details\n\nDuration 3 Months Delivery Online Investment£2,975 (+VAT) per person Group Cost Maximum 5 participants per Cohort Suitable for Return from Maternity/Paternity Leave, Stress-related Illness and any other Long-term leave\n\n### Course Overview\n\n### Come Back Stronger, Sharper and More Resilient\n\n### New Strategies, New Habits, New You.\n\nWhen considering returning to work after a mental health-related illness or a maternity or paternity leave, it is imperative to feel that you are fully equipped with new ways to work to increase your ability to navigate in the workplace, build up your resilience, and even thrive.\n\nOne thing is certain. It can’t be the same.\n\n“The definition of insanity is doing the same thing over and over again and expecting different results,” often attributed to Albert Einstein.\n\nAs an employee, you should feel confident in your abilities to change the way you operate, otherwise, you will go back to the habits that got you stressed and ill in the first place.\n"
